# Local SQLite database (recreated from build/sqlite.sql on first run)
# Leading slash matters: a bare `data/` also matches src/data/, which
# silently excluded the whole data-access layer from this branch's first
# commit. Anchored, it means the database directory at the repo root only.
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
